# Keep the build context small and secret-free. Anything listed here cannot be
# copied into an image even by accident.

# Never ship credentials or local environment files. .env.example is the only
# environment file in the repository and it holds no real value.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.jks
*.keystore
google-services.json

.git
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/.dart_tool
**/coverage

# The harness and the product workspace are planning material, not runtime
# inputs. They must never be baked into a production image.
harness
workspace
docs
infra/vm
*.md
!apps/*/README.md

**/*.spec.ts
**/*.test.ts
tests
